        "MC-Dropout uses a Monte-Carlo inference scheme based on a dropout layer to approximate the models predictive uncertainty"^^xsd:string,
        "To increase uncertainty, Gal et al. [20] leverages Monte-Carlo (MC) Dropout, where uncertainty in the wei"^^xsd:string,
