    :hasEvidenceText "A taxonomy of query strategies for AL."^^xsd:string,
        "Active learning aims to select the most important data from the unlabeled dataset and query human experts to annotate new data."^^xsd:string,
        "The batch-based query strategy forms the basis of the combination of AL and DL"^^xsd:string,
        "The paper explains AL scenarios, query strategies, the analysis of different active learning techniques"^^xsd:string,
        "The query strategy based on uncertainty is an important direction of AL research."^^xsd:string,
        "The query strategy, such as uncertainty sampling, is usually used to score the candidate instances in the pool."^^xsd:string,
        "Uncertainty-based query strategy refers to the model based on sample uncertainty ranking to select the sample to be queried."^^xsd:string,
        "although the hybrid query strategy achieves superior performance, the uncertaintybased AL query strategy is more convenient to combine with the output of the softmax layer of DL."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :dal_strategy,
        owl:Thing ;
