    kg:textSpan "study, Reyes et al. introduced two uncertainty measures based on the base classier predictions and the inconsistency of a predicted label set, respectively, to query the most informative points, and the rank aggregation technique was used for nding the scores across all labels [ 115 ]. 4.8. Stopping Criteria In the active learning technique, the query process continues until a stopping condition is met. As reported in [ 116 ], setting an appropriate termination condition for active learners is a" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/25-mathematics-11-00820_rag__chunk_039> a kg:Chunk ;
