    kg:textSpan "highly consistent with AL as we mentioned before, this package introduces a simple framework to understand the steps of DAL clearly. Due to the simplicity of the code, it could be used as a starting point to build any AL or understand how it works. Also, this package does not depend on other complicated toolboxes, which is an advantage over other software packages. Furthermore, this package contains all the illustrative examples we have presented in this paper. 8. AL: Experimental Evaluation Met" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/26-2009_00236v2_rag__chunk_007> a kg:Chunk ;
