    kg:textSpan "incrementally, or to combine it with existing training data [ 199 ]; however, this would cause the model to be biased either towards a small amount of newly selected data or towards data selected early in the process. In order to solve this bias problem, ActiveLink adopts a principled and unbiased incremental training method based on meta-learning. More specifically, in each AL iteration, ActiveLink uses the newly selected samples to update the model parameters, then approximates the meta-object" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/26-2009_00236v2_rag__chunk_018> a kg:Chunk ;
