    kg:docId "26-2009.00236v2_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/26-2009_00236v2_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "smallest possible labeling cost. To solve this problem, CEAL [ 229 ] assigns pseudo-labels to samples with high confidence and adds them to the highly uncertain sample set queried using the uncertainty-based AL method, then uses the expanded training set to train the DeepAL model image classifier. [ 173 ] first integrated the criteria of AL into the deep belief network and subsequently conducted extensive research on classification tasks on a variety of real uni-modal and multi-modal datasets. W" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/26-2009_00236v2_rag__chunk_027> a kg:Chunk ;
