    kg:textSpan "given problem based on the characteristics of the data and the specic requirements of the application. 2.2 Active learning scenarios Active learning can be broadly categorized into three macro scenarios, based on how the unlabeled instances are supplied to the learner and then selected to be labeled by an oracle. Regardless of the particular query strategy being employed, these macro scenarios provide a framework for understanding the ow of information and the decision-making steps involved in a" .

