    kg:textSpan "where each weight is initialized at 1 D and then reduced according to its creation time The most recent classiers are useful in detecting sudden concept drifts and have highest weights while the old dynamic classiers have lower weights and can help to identify gradual drifts. The same pairwise strategy based on an ensemble composed by a stable classier and D dynamic classiers was used by Zhang et al. ( 2022 ). They modied the original strategy by introducing a reinforcement mechanism to adjust t" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/28-s10994-023-06454-2_rag__chunk_046> a kg:Chunk ;
