    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/28-s10994-023-06454-2_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "for a held-out test set, or for the data stream being analyzed. However, in real life, the key motivation behind active learning is label scarcity and thus it might be difcult to thoroughly assess the effectiveness of the deployed sampling strategy. Human-computer interaction. In the context of active learning for data streams, the synergy between human labelers and computer systems plays a pivotal role in the labeling process. While the majority of online active learning methods focus on queryi" .

