    kg:docId "42-1802.09841v1_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/42-1802_09841v1_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "learning heuristics: among all the metrics, BALD which maximizes the mutual information between predictions and model posterior consistently outperforms other metrics. In this article, we do not consider adversarial examples as a threat but rather as a guidance tool to query new data. Our work focuses on a new active selection criterion based on the sensitiveness of unlabeled examples to adversarial attacks. Specically, our contributions are twofold: We present a new heuristic for margin-based a" .

