    kg:textSpan "BatchBALD: E cient and Diverse Batch Acquisition for Deep Bayesian Active Learning Andreas Kirsch Joost van Amersfoort Yarin Gal OATML Department of Computer Science University of Oxford {andreas.kirsch, joost.van.amersfoort, yarin}@cs.ox.ac.uk arXiv:1906.08158v2 [cs.LG] 28 Oct 2019 Abstract We develop BatchBALD, a tractable approximation to the mutual information between a batch of points and model parameters, which we use as an acquisition function to select multiple informative points jointly" .

