    kg:textSpan "the sample is. The key of the AL algorithm is to select the most informative samples from the unlabeled pool D U . Once the labeled and unlabeled data pools are initialized, a xed number of samples will be iteratively selected, labeled and transferred from the unlabeled pool to the labeled pool. Then the unlabeled and labeled pool are updated. As illustrated in Fig. 1, this procedure will repeat until the performance of the target model meets users requirements, or the budget for annotation runs" .

