    kg:textSpan "by the agent is far from the optimal one. The minimization of this count is formalized in the PAC-MDP setting introduced by Kakade [ 2003 ], see also Dann and Brunskill [ 2015 ] and Dann et al. [ 2017 ]. The second setting and our central focus in this paper is called pure-exploration where the agent is free to make mistakes during the learning and explore more vigorously [ Fiechter , 1994 , Kearns and Singh , 1998 , Even-Dar et al. , 2006 ]. We provide results for two pure-exploration settings " .

