        "46-Gong Deep reinforcement active 2020 Accepted_rag::chunk_001"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceText "Consistency regularization aims to enforce similar outputs under perturbations of input data or model parameters. Maximizing consistency serves as an unsupervised loss for unlabeled samples"^^xsd:string,
        "The basic idea of semisupervised learning is that the lear"^^xsd:string,
        "developing new methodologies to utilize better unlabeled data like semi- and self-supervised learning (S4L)."^^xsd:string,
        "research trend shifting towards developing new methodologies to utilize better unlabeled data like semi- and self-supervised learning (S4L)."^^xsd:string,
        "semi-supervised learning is a technique that trains a model using a combination of labeled and unlabeled data."^^xsd:string,
        "semisupervised learning scheme that decreases the requirement of data annotations."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :entity,
        owl:Thing ;
