    kg:textSpan "speed of CNN training. Nevertheless, as analyzed in Section 3.1.1, this can easily lead to insufficient diversity of batch query samples (such that relevant knowledge regarding the data distribution is not fully utilized), which in turn leads to low or even invalid DL model training performance. A feasible strategy would thus be to use a hybrid query strategy in a batch query, taking into account both the information volume and diversity of samples in either an explicit or implicit manner. The p" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/26-2009_00236v2_rag__chunk_020> a kg:Chunk ;
