    kg:textSpan "be the labeled data for our classication task where the labels belong to set Y = 3 The UncertaintyDiversity Dichotomy This section provides background on prior work in AL . First, we discuss two general AL strategies: uncertainty sampling and diversity sampling. Then, we explain the dichotomy between the two concepts and introduce BADGE ( Ash et al. , 2020 ), a SOTA method that attempts to resolve this issue. Finally, we focus on the limitations of BADGE and other AL strategies to give motivatio" .

