    kg:textSpan "scenarios for ALs: In the membership query synthesis scenario, the active learner generates synthetic instances in the space and then requests labels for them (see Figure 2 ). This scenario is suitable for nite problem domains, and because no processing on unlabeled data is required in this scenario, the learner can quickly generate query instances [ 3 ]. The major limitation of this scenario is that it can articially generate instances that are impossible to reasonably label [ 36 ]. For example" .

