    kg:textSpan "When Active Learning Meets Implicit Semantic Data Augmentation Zhuangzhuang Chen 1 , Jin Zhang 1 , Pan Wang 1 , Jie Chen 1 , and Jianqiang Li 1 Shenzhen University, Shenzhen 518060 , China Abstract. Active learning (AL) is a label-ecient technique for training deep models when only a limited labeled set is available and the manual annotation is expensive. Implicit semantic data augmentation (ISDA) eectively extends the limited amount of labeled samples and increases the diversity of labeled sets" .

