    kg:textSpan "are inherently random. Epistemic uncertainty comes from the modeling/learning process and is caused by a lack of knowledge [ 30 , 46 , 58 , 59 ]. Many uncertainty-based DAL measures are adapted from pool-based AL techniques for classical ML tasks. Typical methods include: 1. Maximum Entropy ( Entropy ) [ 61 ] selects data x that maximize the predictive entropy H M [ y | x ] : entropy ( x , M ) = H M [ y | x ] = P k p M ( y = k | x ) log p M ( y = k | x ) , where p M ( y | x ) is the posterior la" .

