    kg:textSpan "strategy from the following five aspects. Batch Mode DeepAL (BMDAL). The batch-based query strategy is the foundation of DeepAL. The one-by-one sample query strategy in traditional AL is inefficient and not applicable to DeepAL, so it is replaced by batch-based query strategy. A Survey of Deep Active Learning 7 Uncertainty-based and Hybrid Query Strategies. Uncertainty-based query strategy refers to the model based on sample uncertainty ranking to select the sample to be queried. The greater the" .

