    kg:textSpan "sampling, i.e. , constructing representations for all data points in the unlabeled data pool and/or executing clustering on the pool. As the acquisition time depends on the size of the unlabeled pool, existing methods do not scale to large unlabeled datasets computing the representation for or executing clustering over all data points can be time-consuming. Hence, in an interactive setting, a new solution should avoid the computation over the entire unlabeled data pool. Sample redundancy. Given " .

